{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2547 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "e912449d08052bc7b23ba20951e526d7c79e1d0f1cab13d87f1ca6b7d822bf6c" :edb/db-before-t 2546 :edb/db-after-t 2547 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535859 50 #inst "2026-10-09T09:12:59.074Z" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059500 1100 "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/14671e805c18814b31d0c65d0e53c60aae1cf52c60ad8dd146d8a3f4bc823915.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059500 1100 "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059500 1145 "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/e0318c549ab4aa25bf2decb41e45e296406d699706c03aff7ea44724d20edece.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059500 1145 "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 0x+2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059501 1100 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/a5abba041a61cad76d43d5bb13d0fd4e873eb2daf2282e8d9828b8ab79fe2ba0.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059501 1100 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z=0 \\\\ z=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z=1-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059501 1145 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/2f9ae37920ec528a700715658900bbbf3ec4c855767bf06f79d044f488a8bbf2.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/af1499610c0c312a1f5c50d99967a004ae6b3042c3a88ca20a86f922b28aaaff.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059501 1145 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059502 1100 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/4d90e81043121495ae8bb7742400b2c9e705cb7d706f553a6ab2aec44b35d017.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059502 1100 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059502 1145 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-4y=-12 \\\\ 3x+y=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059502 1145 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/3e7f783023405be3ea79a740998fefac3a6ea909e9903f5ea300a9234ae63003.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059503 1100 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/d89417b7eb2d000bbd81fcf4a89ca7eaa5529fc56d9b41bf6e8bb237d2eb9e16.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059503 1100 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{2}=a \\\\ 5+3b-a=4c \\\\ d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059503 1145 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)" 13194139535859 true] [17592186059503 1145 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535859 false] [17592186059692 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370774 13194139535859 true] [17592186059692 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370781 13194139535859 true] [17592186059692 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370787 13194139535859 true] [17592186059692 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370829 13194139535859 true] [17592186059693 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370794 13194139535859 true] [17592186059693 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370801 13194139535859 true] [17592186059694 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370808 13194139535859 true] [17592186059694 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370815 13194139535859 true] [17592186059694 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370836 13194139535859 true] [17592186059694 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370843 13194139535859 true] [17592186059695 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370822 13194139535859 true] [17592186059